  "description": "WUHGIQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H56 Eu3 N21 O14 Zn2. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 4 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.575-3.746 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.35-108.87°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn2Eu3(m-salen)3(N3)5(OH)2]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
